{"speciesId":166,"names":{"fr":"Coxyclaque","es":"Ledian","en":"Ledian","ja":"レディアン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"When the stars flicker in the night sky, it flutters about, scattering a glowing powder."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"The star patterns on its back grow larger or smaller depending on the number of stars in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"In the daytime when it gets warm, it curls up inside a big leaf and drifts off into a deep slumber."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live LEDIAN in countless numbers. There is a good reason for this - the POKéMON uses the light of the stars as its energy."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live LEDIAN in countless numbers. There is a good reason for this - the POKéMON uses the light of the stars as its energy."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live many LEDIAN. For good reason, they use the light of the stars as energy."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The star patterns on its back grow larger or smaller depending on the number of stars in the night sky."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When the stars flicker in the night sky, it flutters about, scattering a glowing powder."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When the stars flicker in the night sky, it flutters about, scattering a glowing powder."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The spot patterns on its back grow larger or smaller depending on the number of stars in the night sky."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il tire sa force de la lumière des étoiles. Plus il y en a et plus ses motifs dorsaux sont grands."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il tire sa force de la lumière des étoiles. Plus il y en a et plus ses motifs dorsaux sont grands."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand les étoiles brillent dans le ciel, il volette partout en semant derrière lui une poudre brillante."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando parpadean las estrellas en el cielo nocturno, se mece desprendiendo un polvo brillante."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When the stars flicker in the night sky, it flutters about, scattering a glowing powder."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"夜空に 星が 瞬くとき 輝く 粉を 振りまきながら ひらひらと 飛んでいく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les points sur son dos deviennent plus grands ou plus petits selon le nombre d’étoiles dans le ciel."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Los puntos de su caparazón crecen y decrecen dependiendo de las estrellas del cielo nocturno."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The spot patterns on its back grow larger or smaller depending on the number of stars in the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"背中の 星模様は 夜空の 星の数に 反応して 大きくなったり 小さくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On dit que dans les pays où le ciel est dégagé et où les étoiles illuminent les cieux, vivent d’innombrables quantités de Coxyclaque. La raison en est simple : l’énergie de ce Pokémon provient de la lumière des étoiles."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dicen que en zonas en las que el aire está limpio, en las que se ven las estrellas, hay enormes poblaciones de Ledian. La razón es muy sencilla: este Pokémon usa la luz de las estrellas como fuente de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live Ledian in countless numbers. There is a good reason for this—the Pokémon uses the light of the stars as its energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"星が 沢山 見える 空気の きれいな 土地には レディアンが 沢山 すむと いう。 星明りを エネルギーに しているからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On dit que dans les pays où le ciel est dégagé et où les étoiles illuminent les cieux, vivent d’innombrables quantités de Coxyclaque. La raison en est simple : l’énergie de ce Pokémon provient de la lumière des étoiles."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dicen que en zonas en las que el aire está limpio, en las que se ven las estrellas, hay enormes poblaciones de Ledian. La razón es muy sencilla: este Pokémon usa la luz de las estrellas como fuente de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live Ledian in countless numbers. There is a good reason for this—the Pokémon uses the light of the stars as its energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"星が 沢山 見える 空気の きれいな 土地には レディアンが 沢山 すむと いう。 星明りを エネルギーに しているからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"On dit qu’il se nourrit de la lumière des étoiles, mais il mange aussi des Baies comme les autres. Il dort pendant la journée dans un lit d’herbes."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Usa la luz de las estrellas como fuente de energía, pero también adora las bayas. Durante el día, duerme envuelto en una manta de hierba."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"While it’s believed that starlight provides it with energy, this Pokémon also loves to eat berries. In the daytime, it curls up in the grass to sleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"星明りが エネルギーと いわれるが 普通に 木の実も 大好物。 昼間は 草に 包まって 寝てる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il se bat en frappant avec ses quatre poings. Chaque coup ne fait pas très mal mais assénées en rafale, ses attaques sont dévastatrices."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Combate asestando puñetazos con sus cuatro brazos. Sus golpes no son muy poderosos, pero resultan muy efectivos cuando ataca en ráfaga."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"In battle, it throws punches with all four arms. The power of each individual blow is piddly, so it aims to win by quantity rather than quality."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"４つの 腕で パンチを 繰り出し 戦う。 １発の 威力は さほどだが 手数で 勝負する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Le motif qui orne son dos aurait un lien avec les étoiles, mais nul ne sait encore en quoi consiste ce lien."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se dice que los motivos que luce en el dorso guardan relación con las estrellas, aunque esta teoría sigue siendo todo un misterio."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s said that the patterns on its back are related to the stars in the night sky, but the details of that relationship remain unclear."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"背中の 模様は 夜空の 星と 関係 していると 言われているが 詳しいことは まだ 不明のまま。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il vole dans le ciel nocturne en répandant une poudre scintillante. Si elle vous touche, quelque chose de positif devrait bientôt vous arriver."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Vuela por el cielo nocturno esparciendo un polvo brillante. Dicen que entrar en contacto con este polvo trae buena suerte."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It flies through the night sky, sprinkling sparkly dust. According to some, if that dust sticks to you, good things will happen to you."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"きらめく 粉を 振りまきながら 夜空を 飛ぶ。 粉が 身体に つくと いいことが あるといわれる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":166,"moves":[{"name":"comet-punch","learns":[[3,"level-up",15],[4,"level-up",15],[5,"level-up",15],[6,"level-up",15],[7,"level-up",15],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",9],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",24],[18,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[